                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \alpha^{sk}_{F,G}:sk(F)\circ sk(G)\Rightarrow sk(F\circ G)
              is defined by
              .maruku-equation
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msubsup
                        %mi α
