          %ol
            %li The axiom of choice holds.
            %li Any two ana-equivalent categories are strongly equivalent.
            %li Any two weakly equivalent categories are strongly equivalent.
            %li Every small category has a weak skeleton.
            %li Every small category has a coskeleton.
            %li Any two weak skeletons of a given small category are isomorphic.
            %li Any two coskeletons of a given small category are isomorphic.
